    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>AS REAL AS IT GETS ON A 686</i></strong></h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827200/extras/e049c36c3b479e2cf387d9340d563a52.avif?t=1747290112\" /></div><br><br>RSOD is as cyberpunk as legally permissible. Everything glows or has a flat videogamey texture. Objects have sharp black outlines, like an anime. All the maps are honest geometry with 1:1 physics on almost every triangle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827200/extras/65b90f922d2f6baa2e31070117e04c07.poster.avif?t=1747290112\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827200/extras/65b90f922d2f6baa2e31070117e04c07.webm?t=1747290112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827200/extras/65b90f922d2f6baa2e31070117e04c07.mp4?t=1747290112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Shoot some zombies, or catgirls, rednecks, or cyborgs. Hitscan, projectiles, ranged and melee. Engage in content. Experience graphics.<br><br>Development is ongoing and the release date may be pushed back until the base game has sufficient content.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>AS REAL AS IT GETS ON A 686</i></strong></h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827200/extras/e049c36c3b479e2cf387d9340d563a52.avif?t=1747290112\" /></div><br><br>RSOD is as cyberpunk as legally permissible. Everything glows or has a flat videogamey texture. Objects have sharp black outlines, like an anime. All the maps are honest geometry with 1:1 physics on almost every triangle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827200/extras/65b90f922d2f6baa2e31070117e04c07.poster.avif?t=1747290112\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827200/extras/65b90f922d2f6baa2e31070117e04c07.webm?t=1747290112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1827200/extras/65b90f922d2f6baa2e31070117e04c07.mp4?t=1747290112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Shoot some zombies, or catgirls, rednecks, or cyborgs. Hitscan, projectiles, ranged and melee. Engage in content. Experience graphics.<br><br>Development is ongoing and the release date may be pushed back until the base game has sufficient content.",
